OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1785656875
OL,3,CTrump says he will halt Iran strikes
OL,4,Cafter conditions met for deal to end
OL,5,Cwar
OL,7,FUS President Donald Trump said he will
OL,8,Forder American forces to hold off on
OL,9,Fnew strikes against Iran, claiming
OL,10,Fallies in the Middle East had reached
OL,11,Fthe parameters of a deal to end the
OL,12,Ffive-month war.
OL,14,FThe emerging deal "would include the
OL,15,FImmediate, Complete, and Total OPENING
OL,16,FOF THE HORMUZ STRAIT, and an end to
OL,17,FIran's nuclear threat," Trump wrote in
OL,18,Fa Saturday evening social media post.
OL,26,@vD@SOUyD@WO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
