OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,304,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30302
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1785656875
OL,3,CTrump says he will halt Iran strikes
OL,4,Cafter conditions met for deal to end
OL,5,Cwar
OL,7,F"Based on this request, I have agreed,
OL,8,Ffor the future benefit of the WORLD
OL,9,Fand, likewise, the survival of a
OL,10,Fsuccessful and prosperous Iran, to
OL,11,Fcancel the attack, subject to being
OL,12,Fable to rapidly make a DEAL," Trump
OL,13,Fsaid.
OL,15,FIsrael agreed to join the US in the
OL,16,Fcommitment to try to complete the
OL,17,Fagreement with Iran that would bring
OL,18,Fabout an end to the war, he added.
OL,19,FIran did not offer any immediate
OL,20,Fpublic reaction to the announcement.
OL,26,@oD@AOUtD@]O]
