OL,3,CTrump says he will halt Iran strikes
OL,4,Cafter conditions met for deal to end
OL,5,Cwar
OL,7,FTrump's announcement marked another
OL,8,Fturn in the conflict a day after he
OL,9,Fhad suggested the US was close to
OL,10,Fresuming heavy military strikes to
OL,11,Fforce Tehran to the negotiating table.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
