OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1785656875
OL,3,CTrump says he will halt Iran strikes
OL,4,Cafter conditions met for deal to end
OL,5,Cwar
OL,7,FThe US and Israel attacked Iran on
OL,8,FFebruary 28, starting a war that Trump
OL,9,Fsaid was aimed at destroying Tehran's
OL,10,Fmissile capabilities, preventing it
OL,11,Ffrom obtaining a nuclear weapon and
OL,12,Fending its support for allied armed
OL,13,Fgroups. But the stated goals and
OL,14,Ftimelines for the conflict have
OL,15,Frepeatedly shifted, and an earlier mid-
OL,16,FJune deal to stop the fighting
OL,17,Fcrumbled within weeks.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
