FL,304,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30305
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1785656875
OL,3,CTrump says he will halt Iran strikes
OL,4,Cafter conditions met for deal to end
OL,5,Cwar
OL,7,FSaudi Crown Prince Mohammed bin
OL,8,FSalman, the kingdom's de facto leader,
OL,9,Fspoke with Trump by phone on Saturday
OL,10,Fand raised concerns about the US
OL,11,Fpotentially escalating the conflict
OL,12,Fwith Iran, according to a person
OL,13,Ffamiliar with the leaders' discussion.
OL,15,FThe call happened before Trump's
OL,16,Fsocial media announcement.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,304,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30306
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1785656875
OL,3,CTrump says he will halt Iran strikes
OL,4,Cafter conditions met for deal to end
OL,5,Cwar
OL,7,FThe Saudis, according to the person
OL,8,Fbriefed on the substance of the call
OL,9,Fbut not authorised to comment
OL,10,Fpublicly, are concerned that Tehran
OL,11,Fcould respond with attacks on the
OL,12,Fenergy infrastructure of the kingdom
OL,13,Fand other Gulf countries.
OL,15,FThe crown prince sought clarity from
OL,16,FTrump on what potential new action he
OL,17,Fwas weighing to take against Iran, the
OL,18,Fperson said.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
