OL,3,CTrump says he will halt Iran strikes
OL,4,Cafter conditions met for deal to end
OL,5,Cwar
OL,7,FA White House official, who was not
OL,8,Fauthorised to comment publicly and
OL,9,Frequested anonymity, confirmed the
OL,10,Fleaders spoke Saturday but did not
OL,11,Foffer any detail.
