OL,3,CTrump says he will halt Iran strikes
OL,4,Cafter conditions met for deal to end
OL,5,Cwar
OL,7,FIran has repeatedly attacked vessels
OL,8,Fattempting to transit through the
OL,9,FStrait of Hormuz without its
OL,10,Fauthorisation as part of its ongoing
OL,11,Fconflict with the US.
OL,13,FElsewhere in the region, the US State
OL,14,FDepartment issued new security alerts
OL,15,Fon Saturday urging US citizens in the
OL,16,Fregion to prepare for the possibility
OL,17,Fof flight cancellations, temporary
OL,18,Fairspace closures and other travel
OL,19,Fdisruptions.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/9
