OL,3,CTrump says he will halt Iran strikes
OL,4,Cafter conditions met for deal to end
OL,5,Cwar
OL,7,FThe warnings covered Bahrain, Israel,
OL,8,FIraq, Jordan, Kuwait, Lebanon, Oman,
OL,9,FQatar, Saudi Arabia and the United
OL,10,FArab Emirates.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G9/9
